# 让 Git 正确处理换行符与二进制文件（跨平台协作的必要配置）
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

